  "description": "Dodo, the legendary tycoon cat of Dodo Department Store who inherited a fortune worth hundreds of billions. Kidnapped by a mysterious conspiracy and facing imminent death, he meets a witch and transforms into the stunningly beautiful \"Nahong\" ! However, the penalty of the magic was too harsh.\n\n[A 100-day time limit, and nine lives.]\n\nShe went to rescue his grandmother, but the mansion had already been taken over by fake cats, and the one who saved Nahong from this crisis was Baek-Il, a security guard with a cat allergy. Nahong reveals her true nature as a shopping-addicted cat by swiping Baek-Il's credit card, and Baek-Il volunteers to be a tyrannical butler to tame this parasitic feline…! But to Nahong, Baek-Il is not just a simple human male. He is the one and only \"precious butler\" in the world who gave her the name \"Nahong\" !\n\n“I will protect my grandmother and my butler Baek-Il no matter what, meow!”\n\nFrom the suspicious movements of Dodo Department Store CEO Seol Chil-Guk to the appearance of Do Jun-Young, a mysterious cat killer targeting Nahong's life! Will Na-hong be able to save her grandmother before her nine lives run out and survive forever by the side of her one and only butler, Baek-Il? An unimaginable 100-day survival cohabitation romance with a cat more human than humans!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69648739/), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%B0%B1%EC%9D%BC%EC%9D%98-%EB%82%98%ED%99%8D%EC%9D%B4/4908)",
